#: src/doc.cls.php:69
msgid "This site utilizes caching in order to facilitate a faster response time and better user experience. Caching potentially stores a duplicate copy of every web page that is on display on this site. All cache files are temporary, and are never accessed by any third party, except as necessary to obtain technical support from the cache plugin vendor. Cache files expire on a schedule set by the site administrator, but may easily be purged by the admin before their natural expiration, if necessary. We may use QUIC.cloud services to process & cache your data temporarily."
msgstr "Bu sayt tezroq javob berish vaqtini va yaxshiroq foydalanuvchi tajribasini taʼminlash uchun keshdan foydalanadi. Kesh potensial ravishda ushbu saytda koʻrsatiladigan har bir veb-sahifaning dublikat nusxasini saqlaydi. Barcha kesh fayllari vaqtinchalik boʻlib, kesh plagini yetkazib beruvchisidan texnik yordam olish uchun zarur boʻlgan holatlar bundan mustasno, hech qanday uchinchi tomon tomonidan ularga kirilmaydi. Kesh fayllari sayt administratori belgilagan jadvalga muvofiq muddati tugaydi, ammo kerak boʻlsa, tabiiy muddati tugashidan oldin administrator tomonidan osongina tozalanishi mumkin. Maʼlumotlaringizni vaqtincha qayta ishlash va kesh qilish uchun QUIC.cloud xizmatlaridan foydalanishimiz mumkin."

